{
  "name": "claudeconnect",
  "version": "2.8.0",
  "released": "2026-10-14",
  "notes": [
    "Setup doesn't open your site until it works. Right after Access is switched on, Cloudflare can show a \"not found\" page for a few seconds; setup now shows \"Getting ready\" and waits that out first.",
    "Your chats and plan usage are already on the site the first time you open it. Your computer loads them in during setup, so you don't have to wait or open Plan usage first.",
    "After that first visit, your computer connects within a few seconds instead of up to 15. The page notices sooner too.",
    "Whenever there's no plan usage reading yet, the site reads it as soon as your computer is online, without opening Plan usage."
  ],
